       Global keyboard shortcuts
       ? -> open Diagram Guide
       T -> toggle theme
       S -> cycle visual style
       E -> open export menu
         F -> toggle presentation stage
         M -> toggle Semantic Radar
         L -> toggle Semantic Lens
