    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-dot cyan"></div>
          <h3>Scope</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>A redacted subscription-billing model: eleven tables, the fields the service actually stores.</li>
          <li>Money is numeric(12,2) rather than float; every amount column records a currency or inherits one from price.</li>
          <li>Timestamps are timestamptz, so an invoice keeps the instant it was issued, not a local reading of it.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

