          <li>An invoice may exist before a payment attempt, so the payment side is zero or many.</li>
          <li>A refund is mandatory on its payment: nothing is refunded that was never captured.</li>
          <li>membership carries both foreign keys; a user with no tenant has no membership row at all.</li>
